{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "basis": "User-supplied native MCP plan, 2026-10-12, plus FigCraft from upstream source, 2026-10-14, and the WordCraft (2026-10-14) and SoundCraft (2026-10-16) root flags from upstream source with local binary acceptance; source-level launch candidates otherwise, not binary verification.",
